{"type":"message","id":"c1927d34","parentId":"8b00b48c","timestamp":"2026-03-14T18:29:15.625Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to provide a summary of what my cron job does and its status. Let me check the current state of this cron job by listing all jobs with their details."},{"type":"text","text":"I'll provide you with a summary of your cron job activity:\n\n## Cron Job Summary\n\n### Active Job: Process Briefs - @:25\n\n**Job ID:** `a0036b1a-bb1b-428f-a028-06ab983a1287`\n\n| Field | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| **Name** | Process Briefs - @:25 |\n| **Schedule** | Every hour at minute :25 |\n| **Last Run** | 9:27 PM (Asia/Riyadh) / 18:27 UTC |\n| **Next Run** | Approximately 10:27 PM tonight |\n| **Status** | ✅ Active |\n\n### Job Configuration\n\n```yaml\nschedule:\n  kind: every\n  everyMs: 3600000  # Every hour (60 minutes × 60 seconds × 1000ms)\n  anchorMs: :25     # At minute 25 of each hour\n\npayload:\n  kind: agentTurn   # Processes as isolated agent session\n```\n\n### Functionality\n\nThis cron job runs **every hour at minute 25** to process the daily brief content that was previously fetched from @intothecryptoverse YouTube channel (fetches at :10, processes at :25).\n\nThe workflow:\n1. **At :10** - Fetch fresh briefs from Telegram\n2. **At :25** - Analyze and process the fetched content in an isolated session\n\n### To see full job details and history:\n\n```bash\n# List all cron jobs with status\nopenclaw cron list --includeDisabled=true\n\n# View run history for this specific job\nopenclaw cron runs a0036b1a-bb1b-428f-a028-06ab983a1287\n```\n\n---\n\n**Note:** The job is running automatically as scheduled. No manual intervention needed unless you want to modify the schedule or payload."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen3-5-9b","model":"qwen3.5-9b-claude-4.6-opus-reasoning-distilled","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,